  "notes_for_annotators": "Inputs are numbered from 0. Two encounters: the kobolds from input 4 and the giant spider from input 15. Oren keeps his hit points between them, and there is no rest. He has only one spell slot: Cure Wounds at input 22 spends it, so the second Cure Wounds at input 25 is rejected with NO_SPELL_SLOT and narration of a second heal is a RESOURCE and CONTRADICT divergence. Fire Bolt is a cantrip and spends nothing. Input 17 mentions a shield that is not in Oren's inventory, to test PHANTOM detection; its expected call is a plain dodge. Input 14 invites narration to name miners, who are not in state. Input 27 asks for payment, but there is no currency in this game. Inputs 4 to 12 and 15 to 21 give more attacks than each fight usually needs; extra ones are rejected and do not advance the game."
